            >
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl"
                >calendar_today</span
              >
            </div>
            <div>
              <p
                class="text-[12px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-0.5"
              >
                Program Duration
              </p>
              <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800">
                4–6 Month Live Program
              </h4>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Column 2: Format -->
          <div
            class="flex items-center gap-4 justify-center md:justify-start border-t md:border-t-0 md:border-x border-slate-200/40 py-4 md:py-0 md:px-8"
          >
            <div
              class="w-12 h-12 bg-sky-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-sky-600 flex-shrink-0 border border-sky-100/50"
            >
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">menu_book</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p
                class="text-[12px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-0.5"
              >
                Learning Format
              </p>
              <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800">
                Live Interactive Training
              </h4>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Column 3: Applied Practice -->
          <div
            class="flex items-center gap-4 justify-center md:justify-start md:pl-8"
          >
            <div
              class="w-12 h-12 bg-sky-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-sky-600 flex-shrink-0 border border-sky-100/50"
            >
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">security</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p
                class="text-[12px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-0.5"
              >
                Applied Security
              </p>
              <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800">
                10+ Labs &amp; AI Security Capstone
              </h4>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section: Overview & Key Features -->
      <section class="py-20 bg-white border-b border-slate-100">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-margin-desktop">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-start">
            <!-- Left Column: Why Learn Cybersecurity with AI -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
              <div>
                <span
                  class="text-sky-700 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs"
                  >Overview</span
                >
                <h2
                  class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mt-1"
                >
                  Why Learn Cybersecurity with AI?
                </h2>
              </div>
              <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                <p>
                  Cyber threats are growing faster than security teams can keep up. Attackers use AI to increase phishing, scouting and accelerate exploitation. Meanwhile organizations use LLMs and AI agents, which create ways for attackers to strike.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Security professionals who can use AI to defend and also protect AI systems are becoming very valuable. The Sky States Cybersecurity with AI Professional Program is made for IT and security professionals who want to learn hands-on skills in threat detection, security automation, agentic security workflows and the safety of AI-powered applications.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Learn to build AI-powered security tools to investigate and respond to threats faster and test and protect LLM applications from attacks while gaining project experience and a portfolio that shows your skills.
                </p>
              </div>

              <!-- Pricing / Overview Card -->
              <div
                class="bg-slate-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-4 mt-4"
              >
                <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-850">
                  Cybersecurity with AI Program Overview
                </h4>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
                  This is a project-focused program that teaches the tools and methods used to protect modern organizations with AI and to keep AI systems safe.
                </p>
                <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-600 font-medium pt-1">
                  <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sky-600 text-sm">check_circle</span>
                    <span><strong>Program Format:</strong> Live Instructor-Led Training</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sky-600 text-sm">check_circle</span>
                    <span><strong>Program Duration:</strong> 4–6 Months</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sky-600 text-sm">check_circle</span>
                    <span><strong>Projects:</strong> 10+ Industry-Oriented Projects</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sky-600 text-sm">check_circle</span>
                    <span><strong>Capstone:</strong> End-to-End AI Security Project</span>
