                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sky-600 text-sm">check_circle</span>
                    <span><strong>Learning:</strong> Practical, Project-Based Training</span>
                  </li>
                </ul>
                <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2 pt-2">
                  <span class="text-3xl font-black text-sky-700">$4,499</span>
                  <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 line-through">$6,999</span>
                  <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-semibold"
                    >/ Regular Price / Live Training</span
